# assets/portraits/ and assets/characters/ are intentionally TRACKED —
# Tier 1 source IP. Un-ignored during the video-game restructure so archiving
# the repo can never lose them. Portraits committed directly (static, ~20MB,
# archive-safe) rather than via LFS to avoid an external-store dependency.
# See architecture/VIDEO_GAME_REUSE_MAP.md.
# Negation re-includes the campaign-isolated specs that the broad `campaigns/`
# rule (above) would otherwise re-hide.
!assets/characters/campaigns/
nanobanana-output/
sentinel-agent/generated_npcs/
sentinel-agent/test_portrait.py

